@DIP.AgenticExtraction.Poc_HostAddress = http://localhost:5054

### Health check
GET {{DIP.AgenticExtraction.Poc_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Upload a PDF for extraction
# Replace <path-to-file> with an actual PDF path when running interactively.
# Use Scalar UI at http://localhost:5054/scalar/v1 to send multipart uploads.
POST {{DIP.AgenticExtraction.Poc_HostAddress}}/jobs/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="userPrompt"

Extract all invoice fields including vendor, dates, amounts and line items.
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./samples/sample.pdf
------Boundary--

###

### Check job status  (replace {jobId} with value returned from upload)
@jobId = REPLACE_WITH_JOB_ID

GET {{DIP.AgenticExtraction.Poc_HostAddress}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/status
Accept: application/json

###

### Get job result
GET {{DIP.AgenticExtraction.Poc_HostAddress}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/result
Accept: application/json

###
